## What you''ll find here

Our reporters and editors are organized into teams, each with a section leader:

- **School News** — policies, programs, clubs and life across Avon.
- **Sports** — scores, recaps and athlete spotlights for every Falcon team.
- **Opinion + Advice** — editorials, student voices, letters to the editor and advice.
- **Culture + Entertainment** — music, film, books, games and the arts.
- **Social Media** — highlights from our channels and what''s trending in the halls.
- **Photography + Video** — photo essays, galleries and video.

Behind the scenes, our **Layout + Design** team builds and maintains the site you''re reading right now.

## How we work

Every story we publish is stamped with the date and time it went live. If we update a story after publication, we say so right at the top, along with what changed. If we get something wrong, we''ll fix it and tell you.

We don''t run open comment sections. Instead, you can send a **Letter to the Editor**, vote in our **polls**, or use our **tip line**.

## Tell us something

Know about a story we should cover? Spotted a mistake? Want to shout out a teammate? Use the **Tip Line** at the top of any page. You can stay completely anonymous — leave contact details only if you''d like us to follow up.

